# The stow file packages, in link order, one per line.
#
# One list, three readers: install.sh (bootstrap), scripts/nix-deploy (the file
# half of a deploy) and the smoke test. Order matters twice:
#   - `agents` before `pi`: pi's settings materialize between them
#     (scripts/pi-settings-sync), because Pi has no user-local overlay
#   - `git` last: its url.insteadOf rewrites HTTPS to SSH, and an early rewrite
#     breaks the installer-style fetches a fresh host may still need
# The systemd units are NOT here: the flake ships them (S05).
# `zsh` is NOT here either: Home Manager writes ~/.zshenv, ~/.zprofile and
# ~/.zshrc from zsh/.zshenv and zsh/.zshrc (nix/modules/shared/default.nix), so
# a stow link would collide with the profile.
profile
tmux
nvim
starship
ghostty
aerospace
rex
gh-dash
tuicr
agents
pi
herdr
git
